      "title": "Expedia Group Q3 Earnings & Revenues Beat Estimates, Rise Y/Y",
      "summary": "Expedia Group exceeded expectations in Q3 2026 with adjusted EPS rising 24% to $9.39 and revenues climbing 12% to $4.94 billion. B2B revenues surged 23% to $1.71 billion, while adjusted EBITDA margin expanded to a record 34.2%. The company raised its 2026 guidance, projecting bookings growth of about 10% and revenues of $16.37-$16.43 billion. However, Q4 is expected to show slower growth due to softer operating environment and geopolitical disruptions.",
